00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:09,360
I can still drink. Come on.

849
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:19,440
Where's Wang Yue?

850
00:37:19,679 --> 00:37:21,559
She left with that travel agency boss.

851
00:37:21,880 --> 00:37:23,000
That guy is taking her home.

852
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:24,239
They left less than a minute ago.

853
00:37:26,519 --> 00:37:27,360
Make sure you have all your belongings.

854
00:37:28,039 --> 00:37:28,800
Money, money, money!

855
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:29,440
You haven't paid yet!

856
00:38:11,639 --> 00:38:12,880
A disillusioned man

857
00:38:15,599 --> 00:38:16,920
starts talking to himself.

858
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:22,480
A self-important life

859
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:28,440
can only be fulfilled in the mind.

860
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:32,440
The chasm of emotion

861
00:38:33,920 --> 00:38:34,800
cannot be quantified,

862
00:38:37,360 --> 00:38:39,400
so logic cannot fill it.

863
00:38:44,960 --> 00:38:47,320
This in itself is a simple truth.

864
00:38:51,079 --> 00:38:51,880
Just as

865
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:54,559
one plus one equals two,

866
00:38:56,599 --> 00:38:57,360
you plus me

867
00:39:00,119 --> 00:39:01,079
doesn't equal us.

868
00:39:06,280 --> 00:39:07,679
My father

869
00:39:13,480 --> 00:39:14,800
is illiterate.

870
00:39:28,280 --> 00:39:29,239
My babies in the chat,

871
00:39:29,239 --> 00:39:30,199
this is a dangerous stunt.

872
00:39:30,199 --> 00:39:31,000
Don't try this at home!

873
00:39:31,000 --> 00:39:32,360
Come down and sell it to me!

874
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:34,000
Crap, I couldn't talk him down!

875
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:36,760
Come down! Auntie will take you square dancing!

876
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:38,760
Don't jump! Don't jump!
